{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience Classical Music Like Never Before</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play iconic classical pieces in an unconventional way. Rotate and drop falling blocks to accumulate energy of different colors and compose stunning musical passages. Trust your instincts, aim for high scores, and keep pushing your limits. Oh, and it might even help your neck posture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once a color spectrum is fully charged, all blocks of that color will be cleared.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Piano</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piano keys bounce and shine with every note. Blocks cleared by a Max color spectrum effect will charge up energy on the piano keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo Line</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing rows consecutively builds up combo energy. You\u2019re waiting for that perfect burst\u2014it just might save you in a moment of crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And More mechanics waiting to be explored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689700/extras/ScreenShot_New_Classical_Enligsh_2.png?t=1746422806\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689700?t=1746422806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689700?t=1746422806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689700/7bb7029c23de0249481e5c0f1bee3a716c335960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746422806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689700/7bb7029c23de0249481e5c0f1bee3